    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43679" root="&#xA;                        مل&#xA;                    " body-key="m1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلَّةٌ</span></b> 
                         The <i>hollow that is made for baking bread:
or the hot dust and ashes</i> [<i>in which the bread is
baked</i>]. (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>Hot ashes:</i> (S, K:) <i>ashes,</i>
and <i>earth, in which fire is kindled.</i> (TA, art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خبز</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُبْزُ مَلَّةٍ</span>
                        <i>Bread baked in hot ashes.</i> (S.)
[It is generally made in the form of thick round
cakes.]

